{2}│{R}{1}⦿ List all otter managed containers        {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter ls   [options]{R}                     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter list [options]{R}                     {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter ls --root{R}                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}NO_COLOR=1 otter ls{R}                      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter list --root --json{R}                 {2}│{R}
